rld nested stepping/destruction and callback replacement/clearing are refused. The native scenes contain paths to all four named sites, including CCD; I found no wholly unreached named site. They do not prove unrelated work stays parallel, nor sibling-step safety, nor post-error host completion. Oracle sorting discards callback order, and opposite-answer controls do not individually mutation-test each call site. Remaining uncertainty: no individual site-removal control was run, and no allocation/timing or full-suite rerun was performed. Only the two named reentrancy/error doubts were probed. No files edited or commits made.
